body:
Would be very nice yes.

I believe this could fit in an option of the hierarchicalMenu widget, something like:

```js
hierarchicalMenu({
  // ... other parameters
  breadcrumb: {
    container: ...,
    [template: .... (have a default template)]
  }
});
```

having a POC would be great. We then need to define what's the data sent to the template, an array would be the easiest and straightforward.
